        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$x+5=\\frac{14}{x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-7$ or $x=2$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+5x&=14\\\\x^2+5x-14&=0\\\\(x+7)(x-2)&=0\\\\x&=-7\\text{ or }x=2\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{15}{x}=x-2$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=5$ or $x=-3$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}15&=x^2-2x\\\\x^2-2x-15&=0\\\\(x-5)(x+3)&=0\\\\x&=5\\text{ or }x=-3\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{6}{x}-x=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-3$ or $x=2$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}6-x^2&=x\\\\x^2+x-6&=0\\\\(x+3)(x-2)&=0\\\\x&=-3\\text{ or }x=2\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$x-1=\\frac{2}{x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=2$ or $x=-1$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-x&=2\\\\x^2-x-2&=0\\\\(x-2)(x+1)&=0\\\\x&=2\\text{ or }x=-1\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$x+\\frac{6}{x}=7$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=6$ or $x=1$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+6&=7x\\\\x^2-7x+6&=0\\\\(x-6)(x-1)&=0\\\\x&=6\\text{ or }x=1\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$x+\\frac{32}{x}=18$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=16$ or $x=2$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+32&=18x\\\\x^2-18x+32&=0\\\\(x-16)(x-2)&=0\\\\x&=16\\text{ or }x=2\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 38
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x+1}{3}=\\frac{10}{x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-6$ or $x=5$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $3x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x(x+1)&=30\\\\x^2+x&=30\\\\x^2+x-30&=0\\\\(x+6)(x-5)&=0\\\\x&=-6\\text{ or }x=5\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 45
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{x+1}{4}=\\frac{5}{x}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-5$ or $x=4$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $4x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x(x+1)&=20\\\\x^2+x&=20\\\\x^2+x-20&=0\\\\(x+5)(x-4)&=0\\\\x&=-5\\text{ or }x=4\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 45
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$x+\\frac{2}{x}=-\\frac{9}{2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac12$ or $x=-4$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ne0$, multiply by $2x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2x^2+4&=-9x\\\\2x^2+9x+4&=0\\\\(2x+1)(x+4)&=0\\\\x&=-\\frac12\\text{ or }x=-4\\end{align*}$$\nBoth values are permitted.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 45
      },
      {
        "id": "p9-q2-j",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "j",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{2}{2x-3}=\\frac{x}{4x-6}$",
